.TH MPRIS-MINIPLAYER 1 "November 2026" "MPRIS MiniPlayer 2.3.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mpris-miniplayer \- control MPRIS-compatible media players
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mpris-miniplayer
.RB [ --media-control=\fIACTION\fR ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B MPRIS MiniPlayer
is a compact GTK4/libadwaita controller for Linux media players that expose the
MPRIS interface on the session D-Bus.
.PP
It shows track metadata and playback controls for the selected player.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --media-control= ACTION
Send a playback command to the selected player.
Actions are
.BR play ,
.BR pause ,
.BR previous ,
and
.BR next .
.SH AUTHOR
Christian Lauinger
